# Build context filter for deploy/edge/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in place of the root .dockerignore). Allow-list:
# only the Worker sources, the entrypoint and its loopback relay; never
# node_modules built for the host's platform, local wrangler state or secrets.
*

!edge/
!deploy/edge/entrypoint.sh
!deploy/edge/relay.mjs

edge/node_modules
edge/.wrangler
edge/.dev.vars*
edge/.env*
edge/coverage
**/.DS_Store
